{"name": "The Walking Dead: Streets of Survival", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"FIGHT THE DEAD. SURVIVE THE STREETS.\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"52\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777850/extras/358f4b5c49319a220357c43cfbd37a35.webp?t=1789747431\" width=\"848\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-hidden=\"true\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777850/extras/498b1a8df9138cf6d3e037ed7b4b83f9.poster.avif?t=1789747431\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777850/extras/498b1a8df9138cf6d3e037ed7b4b83f9.webm?t=1789747431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777850/extras/498b1a8df9138cf6d3e037ed7b4b83f9.mp4?t=1789747431\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>The Walking Dead: Streets of Survival</i></strong> challenges you to intense arcade brawling in the unforgiving world of AMC\u2019s The Walking Dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as iconic survivors Rick Grimes, Daryl Dixon, Michonne, and unlockable Negan while fighting through walker-infested tunnels, devastated settlements, and hostile strongholds packed with explosive encounters. Face Alexandria\u2019s most ruthless foes, the Saviors led by Negan, along with overwhelming waves of Walkers as you unleash crushing combos, signature weapon attacks, and devastating finishers in a relentless battle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"INSPIRED BY THE STORY YOU KNOW. \" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"52\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777850/extras/b6214466cba5fcb93978fdc2392e9547.webp?t=1789747431\" width=\"783\"/></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Based on the events of the All Out War storyline, fight through a campaign that reimagines the Saviors conflict that features walkers, threats, and surprises pulled from across the world of AMC\u2019s The Walking Dead. You\u2019ll explore familiar environments from the show - including the Sanctuary, Hilltop, Alexandria \u2013 enhanced by dynamic set pieces, environmental hazards, and intense, story-driven moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"ICONIC SURVIVORS. ICONIC WEAPONS.\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"52\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777850/extras/2f7331ac9672a70899768e107a45f2e4.webp?t=1789747431\" width=\"817\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the boots of legendary characters from The Walking Dead, each with a unique fighting style, stats, and signature abilities inspired by the series. Rick\u2019s magnum, Michonne\u2019s katana, and Daryl\u2019s trusty crossbow are all ready for battle - with Negan's Lucille waiting to be unlocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-hidden=\"true\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777850/extras/e5c7dc5224859adb3043f6e41bc611b8.poster.avif?t=1789747431\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777850/extras/e5c7dc5224859adb3043f6e41bc611b8.webm?t=1789747431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777850/extras/e5c7dc5224859adb3043f6e41bc611b8.mp4?t=1789747431\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"FEATURES:\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"52\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777850/extras/64ad6fbdfab81e68e8e293eb332decfc.webp?t=1789747431\" width=\"232\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Hard-Hitting Arcade Beat \u2019Em Up Combat\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"52\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777850/extras/593d8a6049106cb04b2fa4d21328e032.webp?t=1789747431\" width=\"966\"/></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use brutal melee abilities, crowd-clearing ranged attacks, or a mix of the two in fast-paced skirmishes. Enjoy responsive, crisp, and satisfying fighting gameplay while exploring the apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Overwhelming Walker Swarms &amp;amp; Ruthless Enemies\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"52\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777850/extras/4fe393ee3e858071d66ce97f359283f5.webp?t=1789747431\" width=\"1245\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle through creeping armies of the undead and dangerous members of The Saviors that force you to adapt, assess threats, and fight for every inch of ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Face Iconic Bosses\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"52\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777850/extras/700c849add569dff7cc7f5bd21dfee9b.webp?t=1789747431\" width=\"451\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on powerful, fan-favorite walkers like Winslow, the Well Walker, and more. The Saviors provide their own challenges as you throw down with Negan and Simon in intense, multi-phase boss battles that test your skill, strategy, and survival instincts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-hidden=\"true\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777850/extras/806b09c808c43e6f244c218d10611324.poster.avif?t=1789747431\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777850/extras/806b09c808c43e6f244c218d10611324.webm?t=1789747431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777850/extras/806b09c808c43e6f244c218d10611324.mp4?t=1789747431\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Replayable Arcade Challenge\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"52\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777850/extras/266274bcaa6b1cc7a05916aebdd5728d.webp?t=1789747431\" width=\"726\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master each character\u2019s moveset and tackle multiple difficulty levels in an experience built for repeat runs and escalating challenges. Or jump in with an optional Easy Mode for casual play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Fight walkers as Rick Grimes, Daryl Dixon, Michonne, and unlockable Negan in a brutal arcade brawler set in the world of AMC\u2019s The Walking Dead. Face ruthless enemies like the Saviors and overwhelming walker swarms as you unleash relentless combos, signature weapon attacks, and crushing finishers.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777850/937ee385cc56abc9884b8a372ce8dd44935aec43/header.jpg?t=1789747431", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "2D Fighter", "Arcade", "Beat 'em up", "Side Scroller", "2D"], "developers": "Odaclick Game Studio", "publishers": "Odaclick Game Studio", "release_date": "Sep 18, 2026", "price": "$19.99", "appid": "3777850", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "18 September 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/qp-Td-StFjg", "first_seen": 1789682400.0, "review_rank": 14}